# The worker builds from the repo root (it copies apps/api and apps/worker), so without this every build sends the
# whole repo, .git and node_modules included, to the daemon. Allow-list: only what the Dockerfile COPYs.
*
!apps/api/requirements.txt
!apps/api/app/
!apps/worker/requirements.txt
!apps/worker/worker/
**/__pycache__
